# An allowlist: the image gets the code and the lockfile, nothing else. A file
# that isn't named here (a .env, coverage output, tool caches, a local
# config.json or data/) never reaches the build context.
*
!main.py
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
!src/
!features/
!extensions/
# restore_backup.py and check_config.py run in the container (docs/RUNBOOK.md).
!scripts/

# Ignored again inside the allowed trees.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
# Work-in-progress extensions (main.py skips them, ruff and mypy too).
extensions/_*
